<main>

<section class="bg-white page-hero">
  <div class="wrap reveal visible">
    <p class="eyebrow">Our Commitments</p>
    <h1>What we ask organizations to bring to their commitments, we hold ourselves to as well.</h1>
    <p class="support">Compositions should operate according to the same principles it advises. These aren't values on a wall — they're the discipline the work is checked against, including our own.</p>
  </div>
