<!-- SEVEN GOVERNING VALUES -->
<section class="bg-charcoal">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="reveal" style="max-width:680px;margin-bottom:20px;">
      <p class="eyebrow on-dark">The Seven</p>
      <h2 style="font-size:clamp(1.6rem,2.8vw,2.2rem);color:var(--white);line-height:1.3;">The principles the work is checked against.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="value-list reveal">
      <div class="value-row"><span class="num">01</span><h3>Evidence Before Assertion</h3><p>Conclusions must remain proportional to evidence.</p></div>
      <div class="value-row"><span class="num">02</span><h3>Meaning and Reality Together</h3><p>Communication should not be separated from the reality stakeholders are being asked to interpret.</p></div>
      <div class="value-row"><span class="num">03</span><h3>Clarity Before Complexity</h3><p>The buyer should not have to become a methodologist to understand the work.</p></div>
      <div class="value-row"><span class="num">04</span><h3>Human and Enterprise Value Together</h3><p>Do not artificially separate human experience from enterprise consequence.</p></div>
      <div class="value-row"><span class="num">05</span><h3>Creative Intelligence With Structural Discipline</h3><p>Expression should be imaginative without sacrificing rigor. Rigor should be sophisticated without becoming sterile.</p></div>
      <div class="value-row"><span class="num">06</span><h3>Independent Judgment</h3><p>Recommendations should follow evidence and judgment — not a predetermined deliverable.</p></div>
      <div class="value-row"><span class="num">07</span><h3>Coherence in Practice</h3><p>Compositions should operate according to the same principles it advises.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- OPERATIONAL COMMITMENTS -->
<section class="bg-offwhite">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="reveal" style="max-width:680px;margin-bottom:36px;">
      <p class="eyebrow">In Practice</p>
      <h2 style="font-size:clamp(1.5rem,2.6vw,2rem);color:var(--charcoal);line-height:1.35;">Two commitments worth stating plainly.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="op-grid reveal">
      <div class="op-card">
        <span class="tag">RESPONSIBLE AI</span>
        <h3>How AI is used here</h3>
        <p>Compositions uses AI tools for drafting, research support, and production work — including on this website. It does not use AI to generate client-facing conclusions, interpretation, or recommendations in place of judgment. Dana owns problem framing, diagnosis, synthesis, and final recommendations personally; AI assists the work, it doesn't replace the judgment the work depends on.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="op-card">
        <span class="tag">ACCESSIBILITY</span>
        <h3>An accessible site, honestly stated</h3>
        <p>This site is built with accessibility principles in mind — keyboard operability, visible focus states, semantic structure, and respect for reduced-motion preferences. We haven't yet completed a formal audit against a specific standard, and we say so plainly rather than overclaiming.</p>
        <a class="op-link" href="/accessibility/">Read the full accessibility statement →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

